d five coal-fired power  plants  paradoxically we may make make now this  leapfrog like invest in the modern  technologies so we need to invest in the  new power system so why not in  renewables climate change is already one  of the main worries for the Polish  public moving away from coal use will be  expensive that the EU funding plan aims  to make it as painless as possible  nadine barber al jazeera warsaw
 

